        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the rhythm of the music and step into a world where every shot is driven by the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i>, every shot, dodge, and skill must land perfectly on the beat to unleash its full power. The game features a variety of unique levels, each with its own music theme, enemy patterns, and stage mechanics, keeping every challenge fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of enemies and powerful, uniquely designed bosses—each battle feels like a song that keeps building in intensity, syncing your actions with your heartbeat. Mastering rhythm is as important as mastering aim, turning music into your second weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re shooting in perfect sync, chasing flawless combos, or challenging the toughest stages, <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i> delivers a one-of-a-kind audiovisual experience!</p>",
